<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Grincor, Griffin say talks ended.</title>
<headline>Grincor, Griffin say talks ended.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment holding firm Grindrod Unicorn Group Ltd and unit Griffin Shipping Holdings Ltd on Thursday withdrew cautionary announcements published on May 8 and June 6.</p>
<p>The two companies said in separate announcements that talks had been discontinued.</p>
<p>They gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
